    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to embark on a new journey, test your reflexes and climb the levels! In this fast-paced survival game, you control a glowing orb, navigating through a mysterious, ever-changing world filled with <strong>dangerous obstacles and relentless enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/00d86eee174ba22688c692ca9c52691f.avif?t=1751730460\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 A Thrilling and Evolving Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a challenge to the exit portal, but reaching it won\u2019t be easy! Collect XP orbs to level up and choose from <strong>three powerful upgrades</strong>, including passive boosts and unique spells to enhance your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.poster.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.webm?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.mp4?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 No Attacks, Only Pure Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fighting back\u2014only your skills and instincts will keep you alive! The further you go, the <strong>tougher the enemies, the trickier the paths, and the faster your decisions must be</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.poster.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.webm?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.mp4?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players worldwide! Your ranking is based on <strong>survival time, world difficulty, and XP collected</strong>. Can you go further than anyone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/e4ee1f2b9f9e0a25981e388f6ca8b1be.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Hypnotic World to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>stunning neon universe</strong> of purples and violets, where every journey is unique and every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, adapt, and push your limits in <strong>Glow Journey</strong>! How far will you go? \ud83d\udd2e</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to embark on a new journey, test your reflexes and climb the levels! In this fast-paced survival game, you control a glowing orb, navigating through a mysterious, ever-changing world filled with <strong>dangerous obstacles and relentless enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/00d86eee174ba22688c692ca9c52691f.avif?t=1751730460\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 A Thrilling and Evolving Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a challenge to the exit portal, but reaching it won\u2019t be easy! Collect XP orbs to level up and choose from <strong>three powerful upgrades</strong>, including passive boosts and unique spells to enhance your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.poster.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.webm?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/fe06fb8241a5cc916379c238957588e4.mp4?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 No Attacks, Only Pure Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fighting back\u2014only your skills and instincts will keep you alive! The further you go, the <strong>tougher the enemies, the trickier the paths, and the faster your decisions must be</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.poster.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.webm?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/2d4499dd944cabe78a0d32b87ac6b9ad.mp4?t=1751730460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players worldwide! Your ranking is based on <strong>survival time, world difficulty, and XP collected</strong>. Can you go further than anyone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/e4ee1f2b9f9e0a25981e388f6ca8b1be.avif?t=1751730460\" width=600 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Hypnotic World to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>stunning neon universe</strong> of purples and violets, where every journey is unique and every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, adapt, and push your limits in <strong>Glow Journey</strong>! How far will you go? \ud83d\udd2e</p>",
